[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13088.55, "timestamp": "03:38:08", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13091.03, "timestamp": "03:38:11", "text": "所以，请稍等。现在，如果我把它高亮显示，它会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13096.15, "timestamp": "03:38:16", "text": "不，等等。它不起作用。喂。喂。 N."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13098.55, "timestamp": "03:38:18", "text": "你应该……哦，我没有保存"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13101.11, "timestamp": "03:38:21", "text": "它。好吧，没事了。我的错。什么时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13103.11, "timestamp": "03:38:23", "text": "你把鼠标悬停在上面，它就会像这样悬停。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13105.83, "timestamp": "03:38:25", "text": "这。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13110.309, "timestamp": "03:38:30", "text": "好了。所以，如果我进入正常状态"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13111.99, "timestamp": "03:38:31", "text": "状态，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13116.229, "timestamp": "03:38:36", "text": "如果我将鼠标悬停在这里，它会显示"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13118.87, "timestamp": "03:38:38", "text": "是的，它会那样做。好的，这就是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13122.469, "timestamp": "03:38:42", "text": "通缉。是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13125.59, "timestamp": "03:38:45", "text": "你好。你好。你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13129.11, "timestamp": "03:38:49", "text": "这就是我想要的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13138.469, "timestamp": "03:38:58", "text": "并把这段文字放进去"}]